1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,129
Your passport to global adventures.

2
00:00:03,079 --> 00:00:04,905
This is FlagsRally.

3
00:00:05,905 --> 00:00:13,442
Wherever you travel, FlagsRally finds where you are and gives you that country's flag stamp, just like a passport.

4
00:00:13,392 --> 00:00:19,572
In supported countries, collect the flags of states and regions too, and track your progress.

5
00:00:20,572 --> 00:00:24,370
Join stamp trails at shrines, temples and more.

6
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,518
You can even create your own.

7
00:00:27,518 --> 00:00:31,584
And look back on every stamp you have collected, right on the map.

8
00:00:32,584 --> 00:00:35,618
Safe travels, and happy collecting!

